   "stem": "If $y = y(x)$ is the solution of the differential equation $\\frac{dy}{dx} + 2y = \\sin(2x)$, $y(0) = \\frac{3}{4}$, then $y\\left(\\frac{\\pi}{8}\\right)$ is equal to :",
